{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>旺角發生車禍。今日（15日）凌晨1時許，一輛載有兩名男乘客的市區的士沿洗衣街往太子方向行駛，另一輛載有兩名男乘客的市區的士則沿聯運街駛入弼街，往大角咀方向行駛，駛至洗衣街和弼街交界，兩車迎頭相撞，繼而猛衝撞毀鐵欄和一支交通燈，交通燈頭亦跌落行人路。途經駕駛人士擔心司機被困車內，於是報案。</p><p>兩名男司機和4名乘客均受輕傷，在場接受治理，由救護車送往廣華醫院接受治理，警方正調查車禍原因，不排除其中一輛的士衝燈。</p><p>就現場所見，兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起，路旁鐵欄被撞至變形微凹。</p><figure><img alt=\"兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198458833865936896865704.jpeg/vTLvZjajoOWYNE-afnvf11AN7msJG3OzZz1JNV09STU\"/><figcaption>兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198458837804519424804975.jpeg/rGF_YtRdt-x10PH0WD0uXWWi4McwVvedzPjRK_b40Ss\"/><figcaption>兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起，交通燈頭亦被撞到跌落行人路。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198458829654724608071926.jpeg/CamZ8QpHnSDuUjfoMfBrt6LWhSO5bzaWRh7-UHwe_lA\"/><figcaption>兩車車頭嚴重損毀，其中一車車頭冚摺起，交通燈頭亦被撞到跌落行人路。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"路旁鐵欄被撞至變形微凹。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198459084148314112926173.jpeg/8U6xGoY_X1C45hZF3JLlule_GM7IsBxAC7gfwzG4H8M\"/><figcaption>路旁鐵欄被撞至變形微凹。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198458643779948544196842.jpeg/Kt8DfotLwRxYLHC-SXWqlCoN4X6ph-sLlY0zIq-NMyI\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198467587407613952425016.jpeg/p8mHKVDwEsmzE2RJfn6SUVKlv4JwGnDeBqS7cjyku3I\"/><figcaption>傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198468068305539072672385.jpeg/aUsQmS5zhMPb1CfQdse2ZhC4ft2oIGoq0HuCfOp7gnw\"/><figcaption>傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198468072697106432504791.jpeg/V2_vu-iWV8FX2jDbepreElHuFlJbkAW_U76ZY2m-mWM\"/><figcaption>傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198468076233035776395104.jpeg/PPkl6KfFdLVQsSUqkDRBEYWT_MXhYwBVplo9-ZxaPfk\"/><figcaption>傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261115/1198468079731216384652710.jpeg/E2W6HDdD6TZ897mwKow6zQ-mLoh7Dn4MvbptkIe6bZA\"/><figcaption>傷者清醒送院。（陳永武攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T20:50:27.877951+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":437,"images":10,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T18:21:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T03:28:25.066096+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T20:43:51.787903+00:00","content_hash":"fe1167b3317ac5985acfaa9e6d162de24d763d0c5ed963667a6e8607c980cf33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}